      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The downscaling for remote stickers was intentional, mostly for RAM/VRAM saving reasons.\n\nWe have however decided that for PC players the benefit is too small, so we removed the restriction there. Stickers on PC will now always show as 1024x1024 locally and remote, unless the sticker itself was uploaded at a lower resolution.\n\nOn mobile platforms, including standalone VR, remote stickers will still be loaded at a maximum of 512x512 pixels for the same memory reasons. Local stickers will stay at 1k even on mobile, as before. The resolution of standalone VR headsets makes the difference harder to spot regardless.\n\nThe same change was applied to Custom Emoji, although on mobile platforms only _animated_ emoji will be loaded at 512x512, non-animated remote emoji will be scaled down to 256x256, as more of those can be on the screen at one time (usually).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
